WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:05.359
...Insightful as ever, Eftirvit

00:00:06.237 --> 00:00:09.558
I always find our discussions so rewarding

00:00:12.644 --> 00:00:15.773
It's just food for thought. Could be nothing

00:00:16.353 --> 00:00:17.798
After all, follow the logic through

00:00:17.798 --> 00:00:20.527
And you are forced into some absurd conclusions...

00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:24.833
With the means to summon the essence of a complex system

00:00:24.833 --> 00:00:27.179
The process to extract Azosite

00:00:27.415 --> 00:00:30.280
And technology developed to capture shooting stars...

00:00:31.016 --> 00:00:32.314
We may actually be able to traverse space

00:00:32.618 --> 00:00:34.631
And defy gravity...

00:00:34.926 --> 00:00:38.113
But that's the exciting part! My friend...

00:00:39.123 --> 00:00:40.599
If this theory holds

00:00:40.599 --> 00:00:44.847
We may one day be able to summon the essence of Celestia itself

00:00:45.905 --> 00:00:49.332
Of course, there are plenty of technical issues to resolve first...

00:00:50.085 --> 00:00:53.502
We'd also need a king ambitious enough to permit it

00:00:54.299 --> 00:00:57.045
Your conclusion is by no means absurd

00:00:58.254 --> 00:01:01.273
All of spacetime is intimately connected

00:01:01.749 --> 00:01:06.853
And a rigorous theory is like magic in a scholar's hands

00:01:08.538 --> 00:01:09.993
Professor, your health...

00:01:11.420 --> 00:01:15.364
Today is a good day. I'm feeling much better

00:01:15.597 --> 00:01:19.530
Thank you for your concern, Eftirvit

00:01:20.188 --> 00:01:22.964
I'm so happy to see you, Professor Mimameith

00:01:23.413 --> 00:01:26.980
We've missed having your input at the recent seminars under the tree

00:01:27.274 --> 00:01:28.123
It's a pity

00:01:29.140 --> 00:01:32.769
Hehe, it's no great loss

00:01:33.433 --> 00:01:37.850
There is very little left that I can teach you

00:01:38.421 --> 00:01:43.978
In the future, I am sure you will be the very top scholars in this whole nation

00:01:46.163 --> 00:01:48.886
My only hope

00:01:49.253 --> 00:01:53.688
Is that I might live long enough to see the future you create

00:01:57.581 --> 00:01:59.398
How is Professor Mimameith?

00:01:59.911 --> 00:02:01.676
I heard you went to see her

00:02:01.874 --> 00:02:05.597
Her condition has visibly deteriorated...

00:02:06.315 --> 00:02:07.800
Medical treatment has no effect

00:02:08.136 --> 00:02:11.948
Nor do more direct methods of extending her lifespan

00:02:11.948 --> 00:02:13.797
It makes no sense

00:02:15.657 --> 00:02:16.729
There's only one explanation...

00:02:18.217 --> 00:02:22.043
Chronic complications from His Majesty's research project

00:02:22.287 --> 00:02:24.847
Her health was never the same after she returned...

00:02:25.714 --> 00:02:27.584
You mean the Abyss project?

00:02:28.299 --> 00:02:28.939
Yes

00:02:30.346 --> 00:02:31.743
I won't give up

00:02:32.107 --> 00:02:34.317
There has to be a way...

00:02:34.727 --> 00:02:38.327
Professor Mimameith has always treated us like family

00:02:38.567 --> 00:02:39.512
Whatever it takes

00:02:39.515 --> 00:02:41.184
We must save her

00:02:42.012 --> 00:02:44.214
I'll use all resources at my disposal

00:02:44.688 --> 00:02:47.740
Some of the research at the Universitas could be promising

00:02:48.451 --> 00:02:51.446
Uh, and about my promotion to president...

00:02:51.446 --> 00:02:51.839
I hope there's no—

00:02:51.839 --> 00:02:54.879
Hey, there's a time and a place

00:02:55.459 --> 00:02:56.838
This is not it

00:02:58.642 --> 00:03:02.181
...You're right. My mistake, sorry...

00:03:02.591 --> 00:03:05.056
We should focus on the professor for now

00:03:12.633 --> 00:03:14.466
You've found a way?

00:03:14.999 --> 00:03:15.604
Yes

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:17.556
Mystery solved...

00:03:18.871 --> 00:03:20.031
As you know

00:03:20.183 --> 00:03:23.122
I've been leading research into the Crimson Moon

00:03:23.719 --> 00:03:26.403
Recently, I discovered a more fundamental approach

00:03:26.403 --> 00:03:28.864
To extending lifespan...

00:03:29.423 --> 00:03:31.226
How feasible is it?

00:03:31.410 --> 00:03:33.829
How does it differ from all the previous failed methods?

00:03:37.065 --> 00:03:41.124
This suddenly feels like a seminar under the tree, Eftirvit

00:03:42.386 --> 00:03:43.486
With your incisive questioning...

00:03:43.917 --> 00:03:46.789
We made so much progress back then

00:03:50.350 --> 00:03:52.156
But let's not waste time on theory

00:03:52.616 --> 00:03:55.926
The results will be all the proof we need

00:03:56.697 --> 00:04:00.017
After all, the professor doesn't have much time left...

00:04:00.647 --> 00:04:02.938
Very well. I trust you, Hroptatyr

00:04:03.468 --> 00:04:05.452
I question only the theory

00:04:05.452 --> 00:04:06.690
Not your abilities

00:04:07.857 --> 00:04:09.752
Thank you, Eftirvit

00:04:10.937 --> 00:04:12.111
With this development

00:04:12.386 --> 00:04:14.508
Even His Majesty will be amazed

00:04:15.091 --> 00:04:15.940
Now

00:04:16.569 --> 00:04:20.084
I simply deconstruct the Crimson Moon's power

00:04:20.197 --> 00:04:21.188
And the professor will...

00:04:28.129 --> 00:04:31.000
What is it, Hroptatyr? What are you waiting for?

00:04:31.463 --> 00:04:32.103
...

00:04:32.103 --> 00:04:34.720
It... won't work

00:04:35.792 --> 00:04:37.167
The theory is flawed

00:04:37.623 --> 00:04:39.190
I was mistaken

00:04:39.402 --> 00:04:40.884
...You're lying

00:04:41.043 --> 00:04:43.016
You never doubt yourself, Hroptatyr

00:04:43.309 --> 00:04:44.346
Explain yourself!

00:04:46.135 --> 00:04:49.342
It's nothing. I'll find another way

00:04:49.710 --> 00:04:51.722
Sorry about this

00:04:51.729 --> 00:04:54.526
Are you worried I'll steal your work!?

00:04:54.766 --> 00:04:57.443
However jealous I may be of your career

00:04:57.567 --> 00:04:59.034
I would never do such a thing!

00:04:59.034 --> 00:04:59.448
Our professor's life is at stake here!

00:04:59.448 --> 00:05:01.309
...

00:05:01.644 --> 00:05:03.610
Hroptatyr! Wait...!

00:05:23.670 --> 00:05:26.446
Watch out, it's going to rain

00:05:28.493 --> 00:05:29.664
...

